-- GodDess Solver v3
-- Sources: pose parameter, LBY, jitter history, anim layer, freestanding,
--          per-state hit memory, per-enemy pattern (alternating) detection.
-- Each source's weight and polarity are learned from real hits/misses.
-- Detailed per-shot console log + CSV (goddess_log.csv) + stats button.

